          "name": "OracleText",
          "displayName": "Rules Text Contains",
          "value": "Collect one of each of the 5 Commander 2021 decks themed around <em>Strixhaven: School of Mages.</em><br><br>\r\n<strong>KEY PRODUCT FEATURES</strong>\r\n<br><br>•\t100-card ready-to-play <em>Strixhaven</em> STX Commander deck from each school (2 foil, 98 nonfoil cards)\r\n<br>•\t1 foil etched Display Commander\r\n<br>•\t10 double-sided tokens + life tracker and deck box\r\n<br>•\t17 Magic cards make their debut\r\n<br>•\tReduced-plastic packaging\r\n<br>•\tChoose your college at the most prestigious university for magical learning in MTG's Multiverse\r\n<br><br>\r\n<strong>CONTENTS</strong>\r\n<br><br>Welcome to <em>Strixhaven</em>, the most prestigious university for magical learning in Magic’s Multiverse. Join your fellow students in the colleges of Silverquill, Prismari, Witherbloom, Lorehold, and Quandrix and battle it out with this set of 5 <em>Strixhaven</em> Commander decks.\r\n<br><br>Each <em>Strixhaven: School of Mages</em> Commander Deck set of five includes 1 ready-to-play deck of 100 Magic cards from each college (2 foil, 98 nonfoil), 1 foil etched Display Commander, 10 double-sided tokens, 1 life tracker, 1 deck box (can hold 100 sleeved cards), and 1 reference card, all in reduced-plastic packaging."
